        "message": "=<p>Dear <b>{{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.Name }}</b>,</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for attending the <b>n8n AI Automation Workshop</b> on October 7, 2026. We hope you found the sessions useful and enjoyable.</p>\n\n<p>Your <b>Certificate of Participation</b> is attached to this email as a PDF.</p>\n\n<p><b>WORKSHOP MATERIALS</b><br>\nAll workshop materials are available here:<br>\n<a href=\"https://n8n-workshop-nine.vercel.app/\">https://n8n-workshop-nine.vercel.app/</a></p>\n\n<p><b>STAY CONNECTED</b><br>\nJoin our Discord community to ask questions, share your projects, and stay updated about upcoming events:<br>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R4nu6WeD57\">https://discord.gg/R4nu6WeD57</a></p>\n\n<p><b>SHARE YOUR FEEDBACK</b><br>\nPlease take a moment to fill out our feedback form. Your feedback helps us improve future workshops:<br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1-JdziGTsdc4hBM6yqvjebv7G01fkB0d71nDX7hn-yOk/viewform\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1-JdziGTsdc4hBM6yqvjebv7G01fkB0d71nDX7hn-yOk/viewform</a></p>\n\n<p>If you notice any mistake in your name or have trouble opening your certificate, simply reply to this email and we will be happy to assist you.</p>\n\n<p>We hope to see you at our next event!</p>\n\n<p>Best regards,<br>\n<b>Research and Technical Head</b><br>\n<b>AI Horizon Community</b></p>",
